{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_93_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"一、三十年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"二、夏，狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"三、衞殺其大夫元咺及公子瑕。衞侯鄭歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"稱國以殺，罪累上也，以是為訟君也。衞侯在外，其以累上之辭言之何也？待其殺而後入也。公子瑕，累也，以尊及卑也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"四、晉人、秦人圍鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"五、介人侵蕭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"六、冬，天王使宰周公來聘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"天子之宰，通於四海。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"七、公子遂如京師，遂如晉。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_93_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_93","textTraditional":"以尊遂乎卑，此言不敢叛京師也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}